WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.007 --> 00:00:17.013
The bunnies brought Silvertail to the tree.

2
00:00:17.014 --> 00:00:22.654
Silvertail looked in the hole.

3
00:00:22.655 --> 00:00:26.389
"I don't see any nuts."

4
00:00:26.390 --> 00:00:28.487
Silvertail bent deeper.

5
00:00:28.488 --> 00:00:31.021
"Where are—Yikes!"

6
00:00:31.022 --> 00:00:33.360
Silvertail fell into the hole.

7
00:00:33.361 --> 00:00:40.902
"Ahh!" he cried. "I'm stuck!"

8
00:00:40.903 --> 00:00:45.346
The bunnies laughed.

9
00:00:45.347 --> 00:00:48.988
"The nut thief is trapped!" Peter said.

10
00:00:48.989 --> 00:00:59.256
"Good-bye, Silvertail!" Benjamin said.

11
00:00:59.257 --> 00:01:03.608
The bunnies told the squirrels about Silvertail.

12
00:01:03.609 --> 00:01:05.757
The squirrels stopped fighting.

13
00:01:05.758 --> 00:01:09.163
"I have a great idea," Timmy said.

14
00:01:09.164 --> 00:01:18.252
"Let's share our nuts!"

15
00:01:18.253 --> 00:01:21.720
The squirrels shared all the nuts.

16
00:01:21.721 --> 00:01:25.836
Timmy gave some to the bunnies.

17
00:01:25.837 --> 00:01:29.463
"Thank you for helping us," Timmy said.

18
00:01:29.464 --> 00:01:38.536
"We can save these nuts for our feast!" Peter said.

19
00:01:38.537 --> 00:01:42.639
At last it was time for the harvest feast.

20
00:01:42.640 --> 00:01:49.561
All the squirrels came.

21
00:01:49.562 --> 00:01:52.300
Timmy rubbed his belly.

22
00:01:52.301 --> 00:01:56.603
"These nut pies are delicious!"

23
00:01:56.604 --> 00:01:58.821
Then someone else appeared.

24
00:01:58.822 --> 00:02:02.405
Peter gasped. "Silvertail!"

25
00:02:02.406 --> 00:02:06.355
Benjamin laughed.

26
00:02:06.356 --> 00:02:10.169
"He's not fat anymore!"

27
00:02:10.170 --> 00:02:12.792
Silvertail frowned at the bunnies.

28
00:02:12.793 --> 00:02:15.443
"You trapped me in the tree!

29
00:02:15.444 --> 00:02:18.968
And where are all my nuts?"

30
00:02:18.969 --> 00:02:21.414
Peter pointed to the nut pies.

31
00:02:21.415 --> 00:02:23.020
"Right there."

32
00:02:23.021 --> 00:02:33.958
Everyone—but Silvertail—laughed.
